/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; Posth, Nicole; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob (2024): Microplastics particle morphology in a glacimarine sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972713
Abstract:	The dataset contains information on microplastics particle morphology from microplastic particles extracted from a sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland. The microplastic particle morphology is based on the length to diameter ratio of the major and minor dimensions (obtained from sIMPle software and µ-FTIR data). Particles were categorized as fiber-like if the ratio was > 3 (Fiber = Y) and as fragment-like if the ratio was < 3 (Fiber = N). The dataset also includes information on polymer type, lead-210 year, sediment layer (Depth), major and minor dimensions (µm) and size class (small or large). This datasets is complementary to https://doi.pangaea.de/10.1594/PANGAEA.972635, https://doi.pangaea.de/10.1594/PANGAEA.972712, and the limits of detection are in https://doi.pangaea.de/10.1594/PANGAEA.972709.
Keyword(s):	Anthropocene; Arctic; Greenland; Marine sediment; Microplastics
Related to:	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob; Posth, Nicole R (2024): Microplastics deposition in Arctic sediments of Greenland increases significantly after 1950. Communications Earth & Environment, 5(1), 584, https://doi.org/10.1038/s43247-024-01768-y
	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; Posth, Nicole; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob (2024): Limit of detection (LoD) of microplastic accumulation in a glacimarine sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972709
	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; Posth, Nicole; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob (2024): Microplastics accumulation in a glacimarine sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972635
	Parga Martínez, Karla B; Andersen, Thorbjørn Joest; Posth, Nicole; da Silva, Vitor; Strand, Jakob (2024): Microplastics size class and fractions in a glacimarine sediment core from Disko Bay, Greenland [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972712
Funding:	H2020 Marie Skłodowska-Curie Actions (MSCA), grant/award no. 801199: RECORD: An anthropogenic archive of plastic pollution in Greenland
